OL,3,GNEWSAHow we got to severe drought and
OL,4,Awhat is next
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the start of 2026, records were
OL,7,Fbroken for the amount of rain to fall
OL,8,Fin Devon and Cornwall.
OL,10,FBy summer, the South West was declared
OL,11,Fas being in a drought, and now, in
OL,12,Fmid-October this has been escalated to
OL,13,Fsevere drought in parts of Cornwall,
OL,14,FDevon, Dorset, Somerset, East Sussex
OL,15,Fand West Sussex.
OL,17,FSouth West Water said water resources
OL,18,Fremained under "significant pressure",
OL,19,Fand there was "no significant rain
OL,20,Fforecast in the coming weeks".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
