OL,3,GNEWSAHow we got to severe drought and
OL,4,Awhat is next
OL,5,
OL,6,FOver December, January and February,
OL,7,FCornwall recorded its wettest winter in
OL,8,F190 years, with rain totals reaching
OL,9,Fabout 150% of the long-term average.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
